# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .gitignore for opencode/ (the llmstack package)
#
# Single source of truth = llmstack/models.ini (the bundled template).
# Each project's working copy lives at .llmstack/models.ini and is
# auto-seeded from the template on first `llmstack install` -- it is
# *not* version-controlled, since it's per-project state.
# Everything else that's auto-generated, downloaded, or runtime state is
# excluded from version control - it is reproducible from:
#
#   pip install -e .
#   llmstack setup        # downloads + binary
#   llmstack install      # generates configs
#
# Tracked things you SHOULD see in `git status`:
#   pyproject.toml
#   README.md, UPGRADING.md
#   llmstack/**/*.py
#   llmstack/AGENTS.md     (template, shipped as package data)
#   llmstack/models.ini    (template, shipped as package data)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- OS / IDE ---------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# --- llmstack runtime state -------------------------------------------------
# Per-cwd state directory, created wherever `llmstack` is invoked. Contains:
# opencode.json, AGENTS.md (copy of template), llama-swap.yaml, pid files,
# active-channel marker, models.ini (auto-seeded from the bundled template
# on first `install`), logs/llama-swap.log, logs/router.log, logs/dl-*.log.
# All regenerated on demand -- the version-controlled source is the
# bundled `llmstack/models.ini` template inside the package.
.llmstack/

# Legacy state dirs from earlier versions of the script. Kept here so
# old logs / configs left over from a previous layout don't get
# accidentally committed.
.run/
llmstack/logs/
llmstack/llama-swap.yaml
llmstack/bin/

# --- Install-time artefacts -------------------------------------------------
# In-flight temp files written by the atomic-render helper.
.opencode.json.*
.llama-swap.yaml.*

# Legacy: project-root opencode.json was a manual seed before the installer
# existed. Real one now lives at <work-dir>/.llmstack/opencode.json.
/opencode.json
